# Radiant Cut Engagement Ring With Baguettes: 6 Styles Ranked

A radiant cut engagement ring with baguettes does something no other combination does. The baguettes — those flat, rectangular step-cut stones — run parallel to the radiant's long edges and create one continuous horizontal line across the finger.

That line makes the center stone look longer. It makes the finger look longer. And in yellow gold, the warm metal ties the whole thing together in a way that feels vintage without actually being vintage.

But the details matter. Tapered vs straight. Three-stone vs five-stone. Side stone weight vs center stone size. This guide covers all of it with certified market pricing, 6 real settings compared, and two named rules that will stop you making the most common baguette ring mistakes. Every price below is stone plus setting combined.

