The total side stone weight of 3/4 ct tw is significant. Well-cut baguettes at this weight produce broad, mirror-like light flashes across the whole band length. The radiant center stone delivers fire and brilliance. The contrast between the two cut styles — brilliant center versus step-cut sides — creates a dynamic that makes the whole ring more interesting than either element alone.

The setting at $7,920 reflects precision work. Bar-setting ten individually tapered baguettes to align perfectly requires skill and exact sizing. Each stone must taper uniformly and sit flush within the bar rails. If you're commission-pricing this elsewhere, use $7,920 as a quality benchmark for five-stone tapered work.

